<title>GREECE: TURKEY DOES NOT TAX INTERBANK DEPOS CONTRARY TO MKT TALK.</title>
<headline>TURKEY DOES NOT TAX INTERBANK DEPOS CONTRARY TO MKT TALK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek market talk that Turkey imposes a tax on interbank depos is unfounded, sources in Turkey told Reuters.</p>
<p>Turkey imposed a withholding tax on repos a few months ago, the sources said.</p>
<p>Trading activity in the Greek interbank market had come to a halt for periods exceeding one-month. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
